      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَكَبٌ</span></b>  The <i>blackness of dates;</i> (K;) or <i>of
grapes, &amp;c.,</i> (T,) <i>when they become ripe.</i> (K,
T.) Generally used with reference to grapes.
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>Dirt,</i> or <i>filth,</i> (K,) upon the skin or
upon a garment. (TA.)

